MGate — Third-Party Notices
============================

MGate is a self-hosted mail platform that packages and configures a number of
independent third-party components as container images and libraries. This
file lists the third-party components bundled or invoked by the images and
services built from this repository, and the license each is believed to be
under at the time of writing (2026-09).

