ClamAV and GPL-2.0
--------------------
ClamAV (GPL-2.0-only) is used strictly as a separate container communicating
with MGate's own processes over the network protocol of `clamd` (TCP
`clamav:3310`), the same integration model used by Rspamd and Postfix's own
milter/antivirus hooks. No MGate source file links against ClamAV's libraries,
and no ClamAV source or binary is embedded inside any MGate-built image. This
is recorded here for transparency; it is not itself a legal opinion.
