JavaScript dependencies (this repository)
--------------------------------------------
This repository contains no Rust source (the backend is closed and is
distributed only as the `mgate` and `mgate-agent` container images). The
frontend workspace (`web/package.json` workspaces) pulls in a large number of
npm packages, which are compiled into the static web interface shipped in the
`web` image. They are NOT enumerated individually in this file. The licenses
of these packages have not yet been audited and no generated per-package
report is published next to release artifacts.
